        "created_at": "2022-01-25T00:50:34.632Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I specifically love FA Unity, and ironically hate that the card art makes it look like a Haka variant. I mean, I get it, but still. :B</p>\n<p>Meanwhile, FA Wraith is my favorite piece of art in the game so far. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=10\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> Possibly in both games.</p>\n<p>Also, I think FA Argent Adept is really good, and I like how FA Legacy changes up how the team plays.</p>",
